    "measurementTechnique": [
      "For a full description of the methods, see the methods of Stegen et al., 2022.\nSediments from WHONDRS were extracted with water. WHONDRS surface water samples in conjunction with the resulting supernatant from sediment extractions were prepped via solid phase extraction and analyzed at the Environmental Molecular Science Laboratory (EMSL) in Richland, WA using a 12 Tesla (12T) Bruker SolariX FTICR mass spectrometer (Bruker, SolariX, Billerica, MA, USA). FTICR-MS data was used to infer OM biochemical transformations as in Fudyma et al. (2021)."
    ],
